<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 43-0 IN 2ND INNINGS V GLOUCESTERSHIRE - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 43-0 IN 2ND INNINGS V GLOUCESTERSHIRE - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>BRISTOL, England 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia, 101 runs behind Gloucestershire on first innings, were 43 without loss in their second innings at the close on the second day of the three-day tour match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 249 all out and 43-0, Gloucestershire 350 all out.</p>
